WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:03.836
-White House press secretary,
Sarah Huckabee Sanders,

00:00:03.836 --> 00:00:05.305
holds a lot of press briefings,

00:00:05.305 --> 00:00:07.573
but I don't think they asked
all of the questions

00:00:07.573 --> 00:00:08.607
we need answers to,

00:00:08.607 --> 00:00:10.075
so we decided
to hold another one

00:00:10.075 --> 00:00:11.277
right here, right now.

00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:13.046
That's right --
Sarah Huckabee Sanders

00:00:13.046 --> 00:00:14.714
and the "Late Night" press corps

00:00:14.714 --> 00:00:17.650
are here in our studio
and ready to go.

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:20.186
So without further ado,
it's time for the "Late Night

00:00:20.186 --> 00:00:21.521
White House Press Briefing."

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:29.062 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:29.062 --> 00:00:31.397
Secretary Sanders!
Secretary sanders!

00:00:31.397 --> 00:00:33.599
Secretary Sanders!
Yes, thank you.

00:00:33.599 --> 00:00:35.334
Seth Meyers --
"Late Night with Seth Meyers."

00:00:35.334 --> 00:00:38.771
I heard Robert Mueller's
investigation is almost done,

00:00:38.771 --> 00:00:41.607
What is the administration
doing to get ready?

00:00:41.607 --> 00:00:44.277
-We are preparing to leave
tonight for Switzerland.

00:00:44.277 --> 00:00:46.212
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:48.114
-What did you always
give Steve Bannon

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:50.249
before talking to him
face to face?

00:00:50.249 --> 00:00:51.951
-Additional Scope.

00:00:51.951 --> 00:00:54.087
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.087 --> 00:00:57.657
-What was Donald Trump doing
on a boat with Stormy Daniels?

00:00:57.657 --> 00:00:58.924
-Offshore drilling.

00:00:58.924 --> 00:01:01.394
[ Laughter, applause ]

00:01:01.394 --> 00:01:05.364
[ Cheering ]

00:01:05.364 --> 00:01:07.400
-What are Trump's thoughts
on marriage?

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.769
-It's temporary.
It's not meant to be permanent.

00:01:09.769 --> 00:01:11.738
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:14.206
-What do men use Viagra for?

00:01:14.206 --> 00:01:17.743
-Growing their business.

00:01:17.743 --> 00:01:20.146
-What does Melania want
for her birthday?

00:01:20.146 --> 00:01:22.348
-A small taste of freedom.

00:01:22.348 --> 00:01:25.051
[ Laughter, cheers ]

00:01:28.388 --> 00:01:30.689
-If Melania ever does
try to escape,

00:01:30.689 --> 00:01:32.592
will she have to do it
on her own?

00:01:32.592 --> 00:01:33.625
-I'm sure she --

00:01:33.625 --> 00:01:35.060
If she decides to run,

00:01:35.060 --> 00:01:37.663
which I think the President
states he doesn't feel she will,

00:01:37.663 --> 00:01:39.666
I'm sure she'll have help
with that.

00:01:39.666 --> 00:01:41.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.568
-Secretary Sanders,
I have a few questions

00:01:42.568 --> 00:01:43.969
about the President's health.

00:01:43.969 --> 00:01:46.472
Can you send out the doctor
who performed his physical?

00:01:46.472 --> 00:01:48.208
-Thank you.
[ Clears throat ]

00:01:48.208 --> 00:01:51.044
Dr. Jackson, I heard
that before his exam,

00:01:51.044 --> 00:01:53.279
the President got
so scared of the needles,

00:01:53.279 --> 00:01:55.348
he climbed on top
of the cabinets.

00:01:55.348 --> 00:01:56.983
What did you tell the orderlies?

00:01:56.983 --> 00:02:00.753
-You leave him up there
until he's ready.

00:02:00.753 --> 00:02:03.088
How many vegetables
does the President eat?

00:02:03.088 --> 00:02:04.591
-One milligram daily.

00:02:04.591 --> 00:02:05.858
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.858 --> 00:02:08.094
What were the results
of his brain scan?

00:02:08.094 --> 00:02:10.563
-There's no indication
whatsoever that he has any.

00:02:10.563 --> 00:02:13.699
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.699 --> 00:02:17.370
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:20.506
-On a scale of 1 to 10,
how dumb is the President?

00:02:20.506 --> 00:02:22.741
-30.
-Okay.

00:02:22.741 --> 00:02:25.178
What happens when the President
is a good boy?

00:02:25.178 --> 00:02:28.214
-He can watch as much TV
as he wants.

00:02:28.214 --> 00:02:30.048
-You said that Trump got
a 30 out of 30

00:02:30.048 --> 00:02:31.250
on the cognitive test.

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:33.919
Does anyone else you know
ever scored that high?

00:02:33.919 --> 00:02:35.421
-My 5-year-old.

00:02:35.421 --> 00:02:37.257
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.257 --> 00:02:38.524
What did you say to yourself

00:02:38.524 --> 00:02:40.392
after you saw the President
with his shirt off?

00:02:40.392 --> 00:02:41.728
-I think I need a drink.

00:02:41.728 --> 00:02:43.596
-All right. Thank you.
Thank you for your time.

00:02:43.596 --> 00:02:46.099
Can you send Secretary Sanders
back out here?

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:49.936
Yes, Secretary Sanders,
what do you do

00:02:49.936 --> 00:02:52.038
when you're at a party
on Capitol Hill

00:02:52.038 --> 00:02:54.240
and the deejay drops a banger?

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:56.776
-We encourage the Senate
to bring it to the floor.

00:02:56.776 --> 00:02:58.978
[ Laughter ]

00:02:58.978 --> 00:03:01.347
-What do you think
about Jeff Sessions' eyes?

00:03:01.347 --> 00:03:03.048
-I don't think
they're that far apart.

00:03:03.048 --> 00:03:06.619
-Okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.619 --> 00:03:09.722
How does Trump feel about
getting Eric in the divorce?

00:03:09.722 --> 00:03:12.191
-The President still
strongly believes

00:03:12.191 --> 00:03:16.128
this is one of the worst deals
of all time.

00:03:16.128 --> 00:03:17.763
-When I came
into the parking lot today,

00:03:17.763 --> 00:03:20.299
I saw you sitting on a Harley,
smoking a cigarette,

00:03:20.299 --> 00:03:21.567
blasting Van Halen.

00:03:21.567 --> 00:03:22.701
Why?

00:03:22.701 --> 00:03:25.972
-Because I'm awesome.
-Okay.

00:03:25.972 --> 00:03:27.874
-If you came up
with a new wedding dance,

00:03:27.874 --> 00:03:29.876
like the Electric Slide
or Macarena,

00:03:29.876 --> 00:03:30.809
what would you call it?

00:03:30.809 --> 00:03:32.044
-The Trump Bump.
-All right.

00:03:32.044 --> 00:03:34.013
Well, it looks like
we're out of time.

00:03:34.013 --> 00:03:36.048
So on behalf of the rest of the
press corps, have a good night!

00:03:36.048 --> 00:03:37.584
We'll be right back
with more "Late Night."

